{"lyrics":"[00:11.86]Yep-yep-yep, uh\n[00:13.76]I'm Jack with a bean (Uh), all my diamonds gleam (Uh)\n[00:18.02]Everything that I do, I do for my team (Gang)\n[00:20.38]Walkin' 'round with a Glock and it got a beam (Uh)\n[00:22.58]Hunnid thousand dollars stuffed inside a nigga jeans (Uh)\n[00:26.58]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Ooh)\n[00:29.10]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Yep-yep-yep)\n[00:30.94]I'm that nigga all these new niggas wanna be (Uh)\n[00:33.26]And I won't stop 'til I'm dead at a murder scene (Let's go)\n[00:37.16]They can't kill me, I'm invicible, uh (Bitch, I won't die)\n[00:40.40]Fuck my school and fuck my principal, uh (They can all die)\n[00:43.52]I ain't ever get to principles (No)\n[00:45.74]But thanks to Travis I still got the antidote, yeah (Right)\n[00:48.72]I'm gon' crash the rental (Skrrt), codeine in my Minute Maid (Lean)\n[00:52.38]Diamonds on my dental (Yeah), bitch I feel like Flava Flav (Lean)\n[00:56.24]I don't use a pencil (Yeah), this shit comin' off the brain (Lean)\n[01:01.58]Bitch I need your mental (Yeah), bitch I need that super brain\n[01:05.22]Tell me what you into (Yeah), hit me wit' your info (Yeah)\n[01:10.04]I'ma fuck you, leave, maybe leave a voice memo (Hey, hey, yeah)\n[01:16.60]I may drop your name on my favorite instrumental (Hey, hey, ya' dig?)\n[01:19.50]I may blow you up like a pop with some Mentos (Hey, hey, yeah)\n[01:23.82]Yep-yep-yep, uh\n[01:24.44]I'm Jack with a bean (Uh), all my diamonds gleam (Uh)\n[01:26.00]Everything that I do, I do for my team (Gang)\n[01:27.58]Walkin' 'round with a Glock and it got a beam (Uh)\n[01:29.40]Hunnid thousand dollars stuffed inside a nigga jeans (Uh)\n[01:37.56]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Ooh)\n[01:41.90]Bitch I'm rich, bitch I'm rich, been rich since a teen (Yep-yep-yep)\n[01:45.02]I'm that nigga all these new niggas wanna be (Uh)\n[01:48.30]And I won't stop 'til I'm dead at a murder scene (Let's